# Read by Cloudflare's static assets when the app is built for Workers (docs/DEPLOYMENT.md, "Frontend on Cloudflare
# Workers (staging)"); Vercel sets the same caching for these files itself. Every file under /_next/static/ carries
# a content hash in its name, so a browser may keep it for a year.
/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public,max-age=31536000,immutable

# A static file is served without passing through the Worker, which adds this header to everything else it sends
# (cloudflare-browser.mjs).
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000
